@startuml MyHome_Architecture
title MyHome — Architecture technique Phase 1
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Visiteur / Locataire /
Propriétaire / Admin" as User
package "Frontend" {
 [React + TypeScript
Vite] as FE
 [Pages annonces,
dashboard et admin] as Pages
 [API client + JWT] as Client
}
package "Backend Python" {
 [FastAPI routes] as API
 [RequireRole RBAC
+ JWT dependencies] as RBAC
 [SQLAlchemy ORM] as ORM
 [Private document storage] as PrivateFiles
 [Public apartment photo storage] as Photos
}
database "SQLite
par défaut" as SQLite
database "PostgreSQL
DATABASE_URL" as PG
User --> FE
FE --> Pages
Pages --> Client
Client --> API : REST / JSON + Bearer JWT
API --> RBAC
RBAC --> ORM
API --> Photos : annonces
API --> PrivateFiles : documents locataires
ORM --> SQLite
ORM --> PG
note right of RBAC
 Rôles persistés: tenant / landlord / admin.
 Le visiteur est anonyme. Les comptes admin sont
 provisionnés par l'opérateur du serveur.
end note
@enduml
